--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No raw data is redistributed here. The HAPNEST genotypes were simulated by
Koka et al. (2026) and are available from Harvard Dataverse,
doi:10.7910/DVN/RZ3FZT; experiments/sec4_3_hapnest/prepare_hapnest_small.sh
downloads them. The TCGA-KIRC expression and survival data is downloaded from
UCSC Xena by experiments/sec4_4_kirc/kirc_data.py.
